{%- comment -%}
  Default Privacy Policy (design: Privacy.dc), rendered by
  snippets/somna-policy-doc.liquid while the page body is empty.
  part: 'toc' (On this page links) or 'body'.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if part == 'toc' -%}
  <a href="#who">1. Who we are</a>
  <a href="#collect">2. Information we collect</a>
  <a href="#use">3. How we use it</a>
  <a href="#cookies">4. Cookies &amp; tracking</a>
  <a href="#share">5. Who we share it with</a>
  <a href="#rights">6. Your rights &amp; choices</a>
  <a href="#retention">7. How long we keep it</a>
  <a href="#security">8. Security</a>
  <a href="#children">9. Children</a>
  <a href="#transfers">10. International transfers</a>
  <a href="#changes">11. Changes to this policy</a>
  <a href="#contact">12. Contact us</a>
{%- else -%}
  {%- capture legal_url -%}{%- render 'somna-policy-url', handle: 'legal-notice' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture dns_url -%}{%- render 'somna-policy-url', handle: 'do-not-sell' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture contact_url -%}{%- render 'somna-policy-url', handle: 'contact-information' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- render 'somna-policy-glance', items: "We collect what we need to ship your order, support you and improve the store|We don't sell your personal information|You can access, correct or delete your data at any time|You can opt out of marketing emails and ad cookies" -%}

  <h2 id="who">1. Who We Are</h2>
  <p>[{AppName} legal entity name] ("{AppName}", "we", "us") operates [yourdomain].com. We are the controller of the personal information described in this policy. Our registered address is listed on our <a href="{{ legal_url }}">Legal Notice</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="collect">2. Information We Collect</h2>
  <div class="s-table-box">
    <table class="s-pol-table" style="min-width: 520px;">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">What</th><th scope="col">Examples</th><th scope="col">Where it comes from</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Contact details</td><td>Name, email, phone, shipping address</td><td>You, at checkout or sign-up</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Order details</td><td>Products bought, order history, returns</td><td>Your orders</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Payment details</td><td>Card type, last 4 digits (full numbers are handled by our payment processors)</td><td>Shopify Payments, PayPal, [others]</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Device and usage</td><td>IP address, browser, pages viewed, referring site</td><td>Cookies and similar tools</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Communications</td><td>Support messages, reviews, quiz answers, survey responses</td><td>You</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="use">3. How We Use It</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To process and ship your order, and handle returns and warranty claims</li>
    <li>To answer your questions and provide support</li>
    <li>To send order updates and, if you opt in, marketing emails or texts</li>
    <li>To personalise recommendations, such as your sleep quiz results</li>
    <li>To prevent fraud and keep the store secure</li>
    <li>To meet legal, tax and accounting obligations</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="cookies">4. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
  <p>We use essential cookies to run the store and, with your consent where required, analytics and advertising cookies from partners such as [Google, Meta, TikTok, Klaviyo]. You can change your choices any time from the <a href="#cookies">Cookie Preferences</a> link in our footer, or block cookies in your browser.</p>

  <h2 id="share">5. Who We Share It With</h2>
  <p>We share information only with service providers who help us run {AppName}, under contracts that limit how they use it: our e-commerce platform (Shopify), payment processors, shipping carriers, customer support and review tools, email and SMS providers, and analytics partners. We may also disclose information if required by law or to protect our rights.</p>
  <p>We do not sell personal information. Some ad cookies may count as "sharing" under certain US state laws; you can opt out using the <a href="{{ dns_url }}">Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information</a> link.</p>

  <h2 id="rights">6. Your Rights &amp; Choices</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li>
    <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
    <li>Delete your information</li>
    <li>Receive a copy in a portable format</li>
    <li>Opt out of targeted advertising, sale or sharing</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent and unsubscribe from marketing at any time</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To make a request, email [privacy@yourdomain.com]. We'll verify your identity and respond within [30] days. We won't treat you differently for exercising your rights.</p>

  <h2 id="retention">7. How Long We Keep It</h2>
  <p>We keep order records for [X] years for tax and warranty purposes, and marketing data until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete it. Other data is kept only as long as needed for the purposes above.</p>

  <h2 id="security">8. Security</h2>
  <p>We use industry-standard safeguards, including encrypted checkout. No system is perfectly secure, so please contact us right away if you think your account has been compromised.</p>

  <h2 id="children">9. Children</h2>
  <p>Our store isn't directed at children under [13 / 16], and we don't knowingly collect their information. If you think a child has given us data, contact us and we'll delete it.</p>

  <h2 id="transfers">10. International Transfers</h2>
  <p>Our service providers may process data outside your country, including in the United States. Where required, we rely on appropriate safeguards such as Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>

  <h2 id="changes">11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. We'll change the effective date above and, for significant changes, let you know by email or a notice on the site.</p>

  <h2 id="contact">12. Contact Us</h2>
  {%- render 'somna-policy-cta', title: 'Privacy questions or requests?', text: 'Email [privacy@yourdomain.com] or write to [registered address].', label: 'Contact Us', url: contact_url -%}
{%- endif -%}
